<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in moderately heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 8.95 to 5921.67.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.00 to 370.35.</p>
<p>The average price per share was off $0.11.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1244 to 1080.</p>
<p>Volume was 394,950,750 compared with 405,960,260 on Wednesday.</p>
